#
# LOAD-BEARING, NOT COSMETIC.
#
# The artifact generators run in `--check` mode as continuous-integration gates
# and compare committed files BYTE FOR BYTE. A CRLF checkout would fail them for
# a reason that has nothing to do with the code. Normalising line endings in the
# repository is therefore a correctness requirement, not a style preference.

*           text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touched, never diffed as text. Parquet fixtures exist
# specifically to prove that bytes survive a serialisation boundary intact.
*.parquet   binary
*.tar.gz    binary
*.png       binary

# Explicitly text, so no heuristic can decide otherwise for a generated artifact
# whose bytes are pinned.
*.py        text eol=lf
*.pyi       text eol=lf
*.toml      text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf

# Generated — collapsed in review and excluded from language statistics.
#
# THE GENERATED TIER IS THE LARGEST ENTRY HERE AND THE EASIEST TO MISREAD.
# `engine/src/econflow_engine/generated/` is 64 machine-written modules emitted
# by `scripts/gen_schemas.py` from a committed artifact. Marking it generated is
# what stops it dominating the language breakdown and drowning a reviewer in a
# diff nobody hand-wrote. It is still gated, far more strictly than review would
# manage, by that generator's `--check` mode.
engine/src/econflow_engine/generated/**  linguist-generated
engine/artifacts/*.json                  linguist-generated
uv.lock                                  linguist-generated
# The third-party attribution register. It is the CycloneDX SBOM and nothing
# else -- one register, named identically by NOTICE, LICENSE and README.md --
# emitted by engine/scripts/gen_third_party.py from the committed uv.lock. The
# one rule it needs is the generated marking below: an attribution register is
# machine-written, so it must not count toward the language breakdown and must
# not be diffed as hand-written text.
engine/sbom.cdx.json                     linguist-generated
